    "detailed_description": "<strong>Shadow of Scintilla</strong> is a first person hack and slash action rogue-like set in a dark fantasy world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fluid Movement System</h2>With the ability to wall run, mantle and use grapple, player can experience a fluid movement system.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brutal Melee and Range Combat</h2>Using different melee and range weapons to fight your way through hordes of enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrades for Different Builds</h2>Choose all kinds of upgrades to make your perfect build, or your weirdest build.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Weapon Combos</h2>Master the art of war by customizing your weapon attack combos.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Secrets through NPCs</h2>Meet all kinds of characters in this dark fantasy world.",
